program	errors/unsafe_struct_name_not_prefixed.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	an unsafe type must be named `Unsafe*`, but this one is named `MmioReg`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: an unsafe type must be named `Unsafe*`, but this one is named `MmioReg`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/unsafe_struct_name_not_prefixed.saw:8:8"
log	"    |"
log	" 8 | unsafe struct MmioReg { addr: Int }"
log	"    |        ^"
log	"   hint: rename it to `UnsafeMmioReg`, or drop the `unsafe` keyword if the type is safe to name, hold and pass"
log	""
log	"error: function `main` is not declared `unsafe`, but its body names a value of unsafe type (`MmioReg`)"
log	"  --> examples/errors/unsafe_struct_name_not_prefixed.saw:11:13"
log	"     |"
log	" 11 |     let r = MmioReg(addr: 1)"
log	"     |             ^"
log	"   hint: write `func main(...) unsafe` — the unsafety belongs in the signature where every caller can see it; if the operation is sound for every input, keep the wrapper unsafe and expose a safe one that checks its arguments"
log	""
log	"2 error(s) generated"
